    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >join us &lt;3</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/22db54100a73acdac851b213928ba27b.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/3f7071e224825ae4ff5d558b9129c69d.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span><br><strong>!!! Dev. Warning !!!<br>Greetings,<br>Until you get accustomed to the game where we play with the coolest square in the world and empower ourselves with various weapons and passives, or until luck smiles upon you, and you repeatedly curse at me, please don't (Please don't, it saddens me). You find yourselves exposed to small developer jokes while declaring that you've fully completed maps with different concepts. As you sweat profusely during the boss battles at the end of each map, please try to preserve your mental health and take good care of yourselves :)</strong><br><br>Dodge bullets coming towards you by jumping between platforms.<br>Discover your own playstyle with different passive abilities and weapons.<br><br>Pay attention to the stones you throw. Unexpected stones can be surprisingly useful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/e8a647fb1f7637dc3b86fd5668d57ea7.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/e8a647fb1f7637dc3b86fd5668d57ea7.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/e8a647fb1f7637dc3b86fd5668d57ea7.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>GUNS</strong><br><br>The rocket is a powerful weapon, capable of taking out multiple enemies at once,<br>but it moves slowly. Play strategically to hit moving targets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/c10ed2807addde34b42740f74ca67e18.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/c10ed2807addde34b42740f74ca67e18.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/c10ed2807addde34b42740f74ca67e18.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use the machine gun to eliminate multiple enemies at once;<br>it's easier than killing enemies by throwing stones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/7c195daa760ff271897a5b01600224ba.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/7c195daa760ff271897a5b01600224ba.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/7c195daa760ff271897a5b01600224ba.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/2381ee64ec8e4d5e58e09be4eab1a041.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span><br>There are multiple characters in this game, each with their own strengths.<br>You can manipulate time to your advantage,<br>set up portals on walls to ambush enemies,<br>and play with many other characters like these.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/cb9f4f430f44f6fc014322dd917a5dfc.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/2e53c8b7895023059d0ca46214148abe.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span><br>Each level features unique end-of-level monsters,<br>and each level offers a different gameplay experience.<br><br>Enemies are multiplying and getting stronger. Best of luck on your journey to become the most powerful square!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/a0040d35f199a7b9f40381ccb1b73c99.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/a0040d35f199a7b9f40381ccb1b73c99.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/a0040d35f199a7b9f40381ccb1b73c99.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>-&gt; Different characters to customize your adventure<br>-&gt; Numerous spells and weapons to enhance your fun<br>-&gt; Kill them all and SURVIVE!<br><br>HaHa, a fantastic and entertaining horror game with rogue-lite elements, where your choices will quickly have a significant impact against hordes of approaching monsters. The enemies keep increasing in numbers and growing stronger. The circle is closing in, so become strong enough to save not only yourself but also your friends!<br><br>Join the fun adventure with your friends in this journey that feels like a bullet hell, where you can move comfortably with simple movement controls and wield customizable weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/0d668aced70534aaf188b6608e121218.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/0d668aced70534aaf188b6608e121218.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/0d668aced70534aaf188b6608e121218.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/3f7071e224825ae4ff5d558b9129c69d.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span><br><strong>!!! Dev. Warning !!!<br>Greetings,<br>Until you get accustomed to the game where we play with the coolest square in the world and empower ourselves with various weapons and passives, or until luck smiles upon you, and you repeatedly curse at me, please don't (Please don't, it saddens me). You find yourselves exposed to small developer jokes while declaring that you've fully completed maps with different concepts. As you sweat profusely during the boss battles at the end of each map, please try to preserve your mental health and take good care of yourselves :)</strong><br><br>Dodge bullets coming towards you by jumping between platforms.<br>Discover your own playstyle with different passive abilities and weapons.<br><br>Pay attention to the stones you throw. Unexpected stones can be surprisingly useful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/e8a647fb1f7637dc3b86fd5668d57ea7.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/e8a647fb1f7637dc3b86fd5668d57ea7.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/e8a647fb1f7637dc3b86fd5668d57ea7.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>GUNS</strong><br><br>The rocket is a powerful weapon, capable of taking out multiple enemies at once,<br>but it moves slowly. Play strategically to hit moving targets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/c10ed2807addde34b42740f74ca67e18.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/c10ed2807addde34b42740f74ca67e18.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/c10ed2807addde34b42740f74ca67e18.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use the machine gun to eliminate multiple enemies at once;<br>it's easier than killing enemies by throwing stones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/7c195daa760ff271897a5b01600224ba.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/7c195daa760ff271897a5b01600224ba.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/7c195daa760ff271897a5b01600224ba.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/2381ee64ec8e4d5e58e09be4eab1a041.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span><br>There are multiple characters in this game, each with their own strengths.<br>You can manipulate time to your advantage,<br>set up portals on walls to ambush enemies,<br>and play with many other characters like these.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/cb9f4f430f44f6fc014322dd917a5dfc.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/2e53c8b7895023059d0ca46214148abe.avif?t=1745512145\" /></span><br>Each level features unique end-of-level monsters,<br>and each level offers a different gameplay experience.<br><br>Enemies are multiplying and getting stronger. Best of luck on your journey to become the most powerful square!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/a0040d35f199a7b9f40381ccb1b73c99.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/a0040d35f199a7b9f40381ccb1b73c99.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/a0040d35f199a7b9f40381ccb1b73c99.mp4?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>-&gt; Different characters to customize your adventure<br>-&gt; Numerous spells and weapons to enhance your fun<br>-&gt; Kill them all and SURVIVE!<br><br>HaHa, a fantastic and entertaining horror game with rogue-lite elements, where your choices will quickly have a significant impact against hordes of approaching monsters. The enemies keep increasing in numbers and growing stronger. The circle is closing in, so become strong enough to save not only yourself but also your friends!<br><br>Join the fun adventure with your friends in this journey that feels like a bullet hell, where you can move comfortably with simple movement controls and wield customizable weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/0d668aced70534aaf188b6608e121218.poster.avif?t=1745512145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269530/extras/0d668aced70534aaf188b6608e121218.webm?t=1745512145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset